      },
      "_alignment_status": "confirmed",
      "ref": "L016"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R006",
      "order": 6,
      "text": "EffectiveCost MUST reflect all applicable pricing adjustments, including but not limited to *negotiated discounts*, *commitment discounts*, and other applicable discount programs.",
      "keyword": "MUST",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "block": {
        "block_type": "list_item",
        "indent_level": 0,
        "bullet": "*"
      },
      "lead_in": {
        "ends_with_colon": false
      },
      "provenance": {
        "line_start": 17,
        "line_end": 17
      },
      "_alignment_status": "confirmed",
      "ref": "L017"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R007",
      "order": 7,
      "text": "EffectiveCost MUST equal BilledCost when [ChargeCategory](#datasets.costandusage.chargecategory) is \"Usage\" and the *charge* is not [*covered*](#glossary:covered-charge) by other eligible *charges*.",
      "keyword": "MUST",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "block": {
        "block_type": "list_item",
        "indent_level": 0,
        "bullet": "*"
      },
      "lead_in": {
        "ends_with_colon": false
      },
      "provenance": {
        "line_start": 18,
        "line_end": 18
      },
      "_alignment_status": "confirmed",
      "ref": "L018"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R008",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "EffectiveCost MUST equal BilledCost when ChargeCategory is \"Purchase\" and the *charge* is neither intended to cover other eligible *charges* nor *covered* by other eligible *charges*.",
      "keyword": "MUST",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "block": {
        "block_type": "list_item",
        "indent_level": 0,
        "bullet": "*"
      },
      "lead_in": {
        "ends_with_colon": false
      },
      "provenance": {
        "line_start": 19,
        "line_end": 19
      },
      "_alignment_status": "confirmed",
      "ref": "L019"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R009",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "EffectiveCost MUST equal BilledCost when ChargeCategory is \"Tax\" or \"Credit\".",
      "keyword": "MUST",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "block": {
        "block_type": "list_item",
        "indent_level": 0,
        "bullet": "*"
      },
      "lead_in": {
        "ends_with_colon": false
      },
      "provenance": {
        "line_start": 20,
        "line_end": 20
      },
      "_alignment_status": "confirmed",
      "ref": "L020"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R010",
      "order": 10,
      "text": "EffectiveCost MAY differ from BilledCost when ChargeCategory is \"Adjustment\".",
      "keyword": "MAY",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "block": {
        "block_type": "list_item",
        "indent_level": 0,
        "bullet": "*"
      },
      "lead_in": {
        "ends_with_colon": false
      },
      "provenance": {
        "line_start": 21,
        "line_end": 21
      },
      "_alignment_status": "confirmed",
      "ref": "L021"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R011",
      "order": 11,
      "text": "EffectiveCost MUST include any portion of the BilledCost of [*covering*](#glossary:covering-charge) purchase *charges* (i.e., ChargeCategory is \"Purchase\") that is applied to this *charge*.",
      "keyword": "MUST",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "block": {
        "block_type": "list_item",
        "indent_level": 0,
        "bullet": "*"
      },
      "lead_in": {
        "ends_with_colon": false
      },
      "provenance": {
        "line_start": 22,
        "line_end": 22
      },
      "_alignment_status": "confirmed",
      "ref": "L022"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R012",
      "order": 12,
      "text": "EffectiveCost MUST be 0 when ChargeCategory is \"Purchase\" and the purchase is intended to cover related eligible *charges*.",
      "keyword": "MUST",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "block": {
        "block_type": "list_item",
        "indent_level": 0,
        "bullet": "*"
      },
      "lead_in": {
        "ends_with_colon": false
      },
      "provenance": {
        "line_start": 23,
        "line_end": 23
      },
      "_alignment_status": "confirmed",
      "ref": "L023"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R013",
      "order": 13,
      "text": "This requirement applies even when the *covered charges* originate from different cost and usage datasets, possibly from a different [ServiceProviderName](#datasets.costandusage.serviceprovidername).",
      "keyword": "REQUIRED",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "block": {
        "block_type": "list_item",
        "indent_level": 0,
        "bullet": "*"
      },
      "lead_in": {
        "ends_with_colon": false
      },
      "provenance": {
        "line_start": 21,
        "line_end": 21
      },
      "_alignment_status": "fallback_original",
      "ref": "L021"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R014",
      "order": 14,
      "text": "EffectiveCost MUST be 0 for *charges* generated by entities that do not originate the cost and usage data, to avoid double-counting when merging multiple datasets.",
      "keyword": "MUST",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "block": {
        "block_type": "list_item",
        "indent_level": 0,
        "bullet": "*"
      },
      "lead_in": {
        "ends_with_colon": false
      },
      "provenance": {
        "line_start": 24,
        "line_end": 24
      },
      "_alignment_status": "confirmed",
      "ref": "L024"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R015",
      "order": 15,
      "text": "The sum of EffectiveCost across all related *covering* and *covered charges* MUST equal the sum of BilledCost across the same set of *charges*, within the [*charge period*](#glossary:chargeperiod) of the *covering charges*, when both the *covering* and *covered charges* are present in the dataset.",
      "keyword": "MUST",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
        "Requirements"
      ],
      "block": {
        "block_type": "list_item",
        "indent_level": 0,
        "bullet": "*"
      },
      "lead_in": {
        "ends_with_colon": false
      },
      "provenance": {
        "line_start": 25,
        "line_end": 25
      },
      "_alignment_status": "confirmed",
      "ref": "L025"
    },
    {
      "temp_id": "R016",
      "order": 16,
      "text": "The sum of EffectiveCost for a given [*billing period*](#glossary:billing-period) MAY differ from the sum of BilledCost when *covered* and *covering charges* span multiple *billing periods* or [*billing accounts*](#glossary:billing-account), or when only one side of a covering relationship is present in the dataset.",
      "keyword": "MAY",
      "role": "requirement",
      "section_path": [
